# Liquid is intentionally NOT listed here.
# The Shopify theme-check-vscode formatter (the on-save formatter for
# `.liquid` files, see .vscode/settings.json) skips any file matched by
# this file, so listing `*.liquid` here would disable formatting entirely.
# Keep Liquid out of `vp fmt` (oxfmt) via .oxfmtrc.json instead — oxfmt
# would otherwise parse it as HTML and silently rewrite Liquid filter
# chains, changing rendered output.
